# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# BISTA HR — keep the repo (and every push) lean.
# Only the files the published site actually serves are tracked:
#   index.html, colors_and_type.css, bista-components.css,
#   assets/, preview/, ui_kits/, README.md
# Everything below is NOT needed by GitHub Pages — excluding it
# means git never uploads it and your pushes stay tiny.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Auto-generated design-system build artifacts (regenerated, ~1 MB)
_ds_bundle.js
_ds_manifest.json
_adherence.oxlintrc.json
.thumbnail

# Scratch — screenshots & working captures used only while iterating
scraps/

# Raw source material — pasted images, docs, exports (not referenced by the site).
# Delete this line if you want to keep these in the repo.
uploads/

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
